<p>Kadyal jawaan beta maidaa&rsquo;n ko ja raha hai<br />
Thaame jigar ko piche khud baap aa raha hai</p>

<p>1. Deene khuda ko bachaane akbar sa shahzada<br />
Barchi jigar pa khaake khoo&rsquo;n me naha raha hai</p>

<p>2. Qaime me bibiyaa&rsquo;n sab roti&rsquo;n hain peetkar sar<br />
Misle janaaza akbar qaime se jaa raha hai</p>

<p>3. Beta jawaan shah ka ran me hua hai zaqmi<br />
Aankho&rsquo;n me shahe dee&rsquo;n ke andhera cha raha hai</p>

<p>4. Thame jigar shah jab laashe pisar pa pohanche<br />
Zaqmi jigar ko akbar sheh se chupa raha hai</p>

<p>5. Abbas hain na qasim na aon o mohammad<br />
Akbar bhi ab to shah ka marn e ko jaa raha hai</p>

<p>6. Mayyat jawaa&rsquo;n pisar ki maidaa&rsquo;n se shahe waala<br />
Thaame hue kamar ko tanha utha raha hai</p>

<p>7. Jee bhar ke dekhle ab apne pisar ko laila<br />
Beta jawaan tera duniya se jaa raha hai</p>

<p>8. Nouha to aye ali haq kya khoob hai ye likha<br />
Sun kar harek isko aansu baha raha hai</p>

